hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"251","(43) Namaz se so jane wale aur faut shuda namazon ki qaza ka bab: Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, Said se, Qatadah se, Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo namaz se so jaye ya use bhool jaye to us ka kaffara yeh hai ke jab use yaad aaye use parh le."
"252","Harun ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Fudayl ne hum se bayan kiya, Bashir Abu Ismail se, Abu Hazim se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath (raat mein) parhao kiya, to hum bedar na hue yahan tak ke dhoop ne hamein takleef di, to Nabiullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Har shakhs apni sawari ke sar ko pakre, phir is manzil se ek taraf ho jaye, phir Aap ne pani mangwaya aur wuzu kiya, phir do sajde kiye, phir namaz qaim ki gayi to Aap ne namaz parhi."
